@startuml
title Current backend | Mock top-up callback | FR-008
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor "API caller" as U
participant Gateway as G
participant "Wallet use cases" as W
participant "MockPaymentGateway" as P
database "wallet_ledger schema" as D
U -> G: POST /api/wallet/top-ups
G -> W: Authenticated owner + integer amount
W -> P: Create mock checkout
P --> W: Provider reference + mock checkout URL
W -> D: Persist top_up_intent
W --> U: Checkout result
U -> G: POST /api/wallet/top-ups/callback\nTest/provider simulation
G -> W: Public callback; signature validation adapter
W -> D: Find intent by provider reference
alt unknown / replay / status cannot advance
 W --> U: Acknowledge; applied=false
else settled
 W -> D: applyTopUp: wallet credit + ledger idempotently
 W -> D: update intent status (separate repository operation)
 W --> U: applied=true
else reversed
 W -> D: applyTopUp: offsetting debit idempotently
 W -> D: update intent status
 W --> U: applied=true
end
note over W,D: Wallet posting and intent status are separate calls in current use case.\nNo transaction spanning both is asserted.
note over U,P: Mock adapter only; this is not a real-money checkout integration.
@enduml
